      <bpmn:task id="Activity_1eyqht7" name="Update Product Stock Information">
        <bpmn:documentation>This activity updates the recorded stock quantity for a product. Changes may come from a food producer updating their inventory or from confirmed orders and cancellations. The updated stock information is then checked against the product's seasonal availability to determine whether it should be available for customers to purchase.</bpmn:documentation>
